        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The GIF last frame is the Hennion paratype with a copper activator overlay on the dark sclerites and shell, and the comparison figure shows the spot field beside the photograph. The spots are a model, not a photograph of 2 nm nuclei. CV similarity of the GIF against the paratype is 96.0." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
