        dct:description "12 frames, 640x480, sclerite-masked activator — docs/media/chrysomallon_squamiferum_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-chrysomallon-squamiferum-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 6f01b4c5e4c9fa53e8bf2c8825be8b7ccb7fba3c, image/gif, 1370524 B, 640×480 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 894a567dd3d326cd5cec89d99c30cd84dcd4141bbd9eb2f0cc050f1db3e29430 (sha256 894a567dd3d326cd5cec89d99c30cd84dcd4141bbd9eb2f0cc050f1db3e29430), spec_fingerprint e0865ee451716d4a3fa5bd6b6983a8391e5da7f8dc195fece7fe187c823b6b31" .
